  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your thunderous gunplay is daunting and delightful.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Black Powder Spectacle<sup>ISC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add one-half your mythic tier on Intimidate and Perform checks you make in conjunction with this feat. You also add an additional +1 for each of the following feats that you possess for firearms: Greater Weapon Focus, Greater Weapon Specialization, Improved Critical, Weapon Focus, Weapon Specialization, or the mythic versions of any of these feats.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
